# Every text file is stored with LF line endings, whatever the writer produced.
# Added 2026-09-26, after de86aca shipped web/components/StateBillRow.tsx with every
# line flipped to CRLF by a Windows write. text=auto leaves files git detects as
# binary alone; eol=lf also checks text out as LF on every machine, overriding
# core.autocrlf. See docs/status.md, the .gitattributes unit.
* text=auto eol=lf
